    "body": "References #434 #422. First natural-corpus measurement path for the 512-dim zeta-zero-grid state: arm Z retrieves by cosine over evolved brain-state vectors (evolve_state → the exact vector the router consumes), same metrics/caps as the #422 harness, shuffled control + ≥0.5× content-baseline rule. Tiny-caps smoke: arm Z MRR 1.0 vs content 0.06 (band-sliced stored vectors vs full-state — see doc note); full-caps run queued.",
